<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5679" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφελελίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shake all round,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῖαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					285.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					13.361
				</span></i>
			; <i>brandish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				42.318
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>swing</i> or <i>wave to and fro,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				11.465
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφελικτός</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιελ-,</span>
			<i>coiled round,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				398
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφελίσσω</span></b> , poet.
			and 
				Ion.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιελ-,</span>
			<i>wrap, fold about,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφελίξαντες χέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					425
				</span></i>
			; <i>enwrap,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέκνοισιν γνάθους ἀμφελίξασθαι</span>
			<i>close their</i> jaws <i>upon</i> the children, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				1.43
			</span></i>.</div>
